# Workflow Manifest

> Composition state for the active composed workflow. Created by /silver composer, updated by supervision loop.
> **Size cap:** 100 lines. Truncation: FIFO on completed flows — oldest completed entries collapse to summary line.
> **State isolation:** workflow supervision lives here; lifecycle state remains in `.planning/STATE.md` and phase artifacts.

